                "asset": {
                  "content": "# Support generation static boundary\n\n`supportAgent` in `/src/support-agent.ts` passes the result of `buildRequest(prompt)` to `generateText`. The builder supplies `prepareStep`, which can replace instructions for a generation step. Static inspection therefore cannot establish the indirect request shape or which instructions are effective at runtime.\n\nPreserve this working request builder until a deliberate refactor is verified. To make the integration statically inspectable, first add project-local tests for equivalent step behavior, then change `supportAgent` to contain a direct `generateText({ ... })` request with canonical instruction loading on `instructions` and no `prepareStep` instruction replacement.\n",
